Modification notice (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
------------------------------------------------------
Files in this repository have been modified for the Xiaomi 17 Pro (pandora).
Modifications include, but are not limited to:

  - lineage_pandora.mk  — device identifier, model, fingerprint, GMS client id
  - BoardConfig.mk      — screen density, odm.prop, prebuilt kernel/dtbo wiring
  - device.mk           — product package list, overlays, UWB permission
  - configs/properties/odm.prop — device properties captured from stock
  - overlays/           — Aperture, FrameworkRes, Settings, SystemUI, UWB overlays
                          for a 1220x2656 / 520 dpi panel

Files derived from the upstream project keep their original copyright headers
unchanged.


